    "a9222eb4-8d59-40cd-9ce4-bad54c0c56ad": {
      "type": "text-and-image",
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/MohamehIbrahim_a3ba3b43-ea03-44a4-a2cc-5d8ef4d0a5b4.jpg",
        "image_mask": "square",
        "image2_mask": "none",
        "subtitle": "",
        "title": "Meet Your Guide",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "text": "<h3>Mohamed Ibrahim</h3><p>Mohamed Ibrahim is an Egyptologist, hieroglyphics expert, and tour guide whose passion for ancient Egypt led him to begin researching this enigmatic place and time in history, looking for answers to deeper questions that mainstream Egyptology doesn’t explore. Born in Memphis, Egypt, Ibrahim grew up around the mysterious ancient pyramid complexes of the Giza plateau, Saqqara, Dahshur, and Abusir. He is an expert on the legendary star gates, as well as healing and energy modalities from ancient Egypt. His favorite research to share encompasses the lost technology and civilization of his home country. </p><p>As a tour guide, Ibrahim has led hundreds of tours with the intention to exceed traveler expectations with careful attention to all details including behind the scenes access, fabulous accommodations, and exceptional service. Mohamed delivers an experientially authentic history lesson to transform the way you think about your world!</p><p>From the moment you arrive in Cairo, till you board your plane to leave Egypt, the Saba Tours staff delivers an unforgettable journey to the ancient mysteries of Egypt.</p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_style": "primary",
        "align_text": "left",
        "image_width": "33",
        "layout": "left",
        "color_scheme": "1",
        "show_wave": true,
        "divider": false,
        "top_padding": true,
        "bottom_padding": true,
        "lazyload_images": true
      }
    },
    "5b5089e8-59f8-45a7-bb5c-a870d6d956fb": {
      "type": "text-and-image",
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/kk.jpg",
        "image_mask": "landscape",
        "image2_mask": "none",
        "subtitle": "",
        "title": "Meet Special Guest",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "text": "<h3>Dr. Konstantin Korotkov</h3><p>Professor Korotkov’s career spans 40 years of rigorous scientific study, resulting in over 400 published papers in leading journals in physics and biology. He holds 15 patents on biophysics inventions and has authored 17 books translated into several  languages. </p><p>His guiding principle, “Every cell is a living entity that communicates with its environment,” led him to invent the Electrophotonic Imaging (EPI) device.  This breakthrough in Kirlian photography measures the biological fields produced by our body, which show up as electrical currents – some of which are measured with EKG and EEG machines used by medical professionals worldwide. The EPI is a groundbreaking, allowing real-time capture by video camera and translation into computerized graphic models of the human energy system, revealing strengths or imbalances in the body. The EPI measures energy produced in, by, and around, other living organisms as well as inanimate objects, and more than 5,000 health professionals use this technology today. Dr. Korotkov will join this special Egypt Tour in March, bringing his expertise and instruments to measure the mysterious power of these ancient sites and their effect on visitors.</p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_style": "primary",
        "align_text": "left",
        "image_width": "33",
        "layout": "left",
        "color_scheme": "1",
        "show_wave": true,
        "divider": false,
        "top_padding": true,
        "bottom_padding": true,
        "lazyload_images": true
      }
    },
